43","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p048","text":"九年，烈侯卒，弟武公立。武公十三年卒，趙復立烈侯太子章，是爲敬侯。是歳，魏文侯卒。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m048-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"烈侯","kind":"person","person_id":"1za_blw_7lb_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m048-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"武公","kind":"person","person_id":"l8e_pxu_xre","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m048-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"武公","kind":"person","person_id":"l8e_pxu_xre","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m048-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"烈侯","kind":"person","person_id":"1za_blw_7lb_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m048-0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"章","kind":"person","person_id":"1za_blw_7lb_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m048-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"敬侯","kind":"person","person_id":"1za_blw_7lb_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m048-0036","start":36,"end":39,"surface":"魏文侯","kind":"person","person_id":"eva_gs1_9n5","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","book_id":"b-shiji-043","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-043","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao","source":{"title":"史記／卷043","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷043","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷043&oldid=7903603","revision_id":7903603,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"121段正文及1段分層索隱述贊；排除2個dd導覽，只去除段落外緣空白。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"editorial_readings":[],"extraction_note":"固定修訂與取得